
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_RAPID_MOBILIZATION]
Rapid mobilization

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_RAPID_MOBILIZATION_desc]
In the wake of this incident, any pony with doubts would see that the rock farm’s seemingly flourishing economy may be nothing more than a façade within the Empire’s framework; one day the farm will have to sever ties with the Empire, and rearmament will become the top priority.

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_RAPID_MOBILIZATION]
迅速备战

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_RAPID_MOBILIZATION_desc]
经此一事，任何心存顾虑的小马都会意识到采石农场欣欣向荣的经济也许只是帝国框架下的表象，总有一天农场要能与帝国一刀俩断，军备将会是首要目标。
